"Wonderful %10 %02!  You have come to save the world!  Praise be!  I only hope you aren't too late."

# imported from CZfix2 (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6933
msgid ""
"Too bad you're on the losing side, %02!\n"
"But listen, I'll tell you anything you want--the Temple of Baa will reign soon no matter what you do!\n"
"Just please don't kill me."
