"G'won!\n"
"Git!"
msgstr ""
"Baaaa! <grinning nastily> Baaa! The herd calls, friend.  Why not go and do some good deeds or something?  G'won!  Git!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6943
