# imported from CZfix2 (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6944
msgid ""
"Baaa, friend %02!\n"
"I've heard that you might be just the kind of people we are looking for.\n"
"But I'm not sure.\n"
"You need to get a reputation for doing those things our cult requires…I'm sure you get the idea!"
msgstr ""
"Baaa, friend %02!  I've heard that you might be just the kind of people we are looking for.  But I'm not sure.  You need to get a reputation for doing those things our cult requires…I'm sure you get the idea!"

# imported from CZfix2 (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6948
msgid ""
"<whispering> I'm still not allowed to speak with you, %02!\n"
"Now please go, before I'm seen with you!"
msgstr ""
"<whispering> I'm still not allowed to speak with you, %02!  Now please go, before I'm seen with you!"

# imported from CZfix (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3348 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:695
msgid ""
"So you seek to further your skills with the staff? Excellent! The staff can work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My teachings will raise you to Expert level, but first you must have a skill level of 4 with the staff and of course there is my small fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"Takže vy hledáte vyšší dovednosti v zacházení s holí? Skvělé! S holí můžete útočit i bránit se a nepřátelé vás hůře zasáhnou. Má výuka vás pozvedne na úroveň experta. Nejdříve však s holí musíte dosáhnout 4. úroveň a samozřejmě budu požadovat malý honorář 2000 zlatých."

# imported from CZfix2 (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6950
msgid ""
"Are you soft in the head?\n"
"I said go away!\n"
"I don't need any good deeds done today."
msgstr ""
"Are you soft in the head?  I said go away!  I don't need any good deeds done today."

# imported from CZfix2 (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6953
msgid ""
"Everyone in my secret cult tells me that you aren't nice enough to be with.\n"
"So go get nicer and I'll start talking to you."
