"Shaman: your melee blows deal 0.5, 1, 1.5 or 2 extra damage per point at Novice, Expert, Master or Grandmaster.\n"
"Every point in any of the seven schools also adds 0.5 % to a Shaman's spell damage and 0.25 % to healing, and every 7 points across the seven schools count as 1 point of Ascension for spell costs and healing."
