# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1177
#| msgid ""
msgid ""
"Levels banked: <value>{levels_total:1}</> in all; <value>{levels_mm6:1}</> in Enroth, <value>{levels_mm7:1}</> in Antagarich, <value>{levels_mm8:1}</> in Jadame, <value>{levels_mm9:1}</> in Chedian. Monsters grow with the levels banked in the other worlds: bolster level <value>{bolster_mm6}</> in Enroth, <value>{bolster_mm7}</> in Antagarich, <value>{bolster_mm8}</> in Jadame, <value>{bolster_mm9}</> in Chedian."
