# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/ruleset.yml:6
msgid ""
"Might and Magic rebalance: monsters scale with the expected party, difficulty from Easy to Nightmare, free or horizontal progression, new loot rarities, skills, spells, classes and crafting."
